SUMMARY:Julie Belliveau: Enlightened?
LOCATION:Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:Julie Belliveau is enlightened? Nope! Join this Canadian/Kiwi r
 ecovering Catholic in a high-energy and uplifting journey filled with tales
  of marrying an Irishman\, motherhood\, IVF\, health (sometimes mental) pro
 blems\, moving to Italy and the odd adult nursery rhyme thrown in for good 
 measure. Julie is known for her hilarious storytelling and quick witted cro
 wd work. Julie was a finalist in the New Zealand RAW Comedy Quest and nomin
 ated as ‘Best Newcomer’ at the 2021 New Zealand Comedy Awards. Come see
  this rising star who prompted Kyla Cobbler to exclaim\, ‘What a woman!
 ’ after she stepped offstage.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-
 atlas/event/julie-belliveau-enlightened/
